  "index: false - the query catches other words (ogh -> mogha; diacritics fold, so jāti -> uppajjati, bhava -> bhavati), held back until its query is settled.",
  "A term with kinds (SN 45.161-180, owner 2026-10-20): the word at a word start plus its kinds as the canon lists them, as a regex; patterns are not diacritic-folded and run up to 128 characters. Bhava: its compounds and noun forms, not bhavaṁ (sir) or bhavati. Yoga: the four bonds only, not yogakkhema."
